==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Misa Ono & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

